# Supabase & Security Guidelines

## ⚠️ CRITICAL SECURITY RULES

### API Key Protection
- **NEVER** expose Gemini API Key in frontend code
- **NEVER** commit API keys to git repository
- **ALWAYS** use Supabase Edge Functions for AI API calls
- **ALWAYS** store sensitive keys in Supabase Secrets

### Environment Variables
```bash
# .env.local (Frontend - PUBLIC only)
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxx.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...

# Supabase Edge Function Secrets (Server-side)
# Set via: supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=xxx
GEMINI_API_KEY=xxx  # NEVER in frontend!
```

## Supabase Client Setup
```typescript
// src/lib/supabase.ts
import { createClient } from '@supabase/supabase-js';
import AsyncStorage from '@react-native-async-storage/async-storage';

const supabaseUrl = process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!;
const supabaseAnonKey = process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!;

export const supabase = createClient(supabaseUrl, supabaseAnonKey, {
  auth: {
    storage: AsyncStorage,
    autoRefreshToken: true,
    persistSession: true,
    detectSessionInUrl: false,
  },
});
```

## Edge Function Pattern (Deno)
```typescript
// supabase/functions/translate-diary/index.ts
import { serve } from 'https://deno.land/std@0.168.0/http/server.ts';
import { GoogleGenerativeAI } from 'npm:@google/generative-ai';

serve(async (req) => {
  // CORS headers
  if (req.method === 'OPTIONS') {
    return new Response('ok', { headers: corsHeaders });
  }

  try {
    const { text, level } = await req.json();
    
    // Gemini API call (key from Supabase Secrets)
    const genAI = new GoogleGenerativeAI(Deno.env.get('GEMINI_API_KEY')!);
    const model = genAI.getGenerativeModel({ model: 'gemini-1.5-flash' });
    
    const prompt = buildTranslationPrompt(text, level);
    const result = await model.generateContent(prompt);
    
    return new Response(JSON.stringify({
      translation: result.response.text(),
      // ... vocabulary, grammar
    }), {
      headers: { ...corsHeaders, 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
    });
  } catch (error) {
    return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: error.message }), {
      status: 500,
      headers: { ...corsHeaders, 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
    });
  }
});
```

## Frontend Edge Function Call
```typescript
// src/services/translate.ts
export async function translateDiary(text: string, level: string) {
  const { data, error } = await supabase.functions.invoke('translate-diary', {
    body: { text, level },
  });
  
  if (error) throw error;
  return data;
}
```

## Row Level Security (RLS)
- 모든 테이블에 RLS 활성화
- 사용자는 본인의 데이터만 접근 가능

```sql
-- diaries 테이블 RLS 정책
ALTER TABLE diaries ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

-- SELECT: 본인 일기만 조회
CREATE POLICY "Users can view own diaries" ON diaries
  FOR SELECT USING (auth.uid() = user_id);

-- INSERT: 본인 일기만 생성
CREATE POLICY "Users can insert own diaries" ON diaries
  FOR INSERT WITH CHECK (auth.uid() = user_id);

-- UPDATE: 본인 일기만 수정
CREATE POLICY "Users can update own diaries" ON diaries
  FOR UPDATE USING (auth.uid() = user_id);

-- DELETE: 본인 일기만 삭제
CREATE POLICY "Users can delete own diaries" ON diaries
  FOR DELETE USING (auth.uid() = user_id);
```

## Authentication Flow
- Supabase Auth 사용
- 소셜 로그인 (Google, Apple) 권장
- 세션은 Zustand + AsyncStorage로 관리
